    "html": "<p>The graphs show the variation with time of the activity and the number of remaining nuclei for a sample of a radioactive nuclide.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the decay constant of the nuclide?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.7 s^{-1}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1 s^{-1}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{0.7} s^{-1}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.5 s^{-1}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
